# Keep the build context small, and keep secrets out of it entirely. Anything listed here cannot end up
# in an image layer by accident — which matters most for the two entries at the top.

# --- Secrets. Never in an image. ---
apps/api/.keys/
apps/api/src/main/resources/application-local.yml
.env
.env.*

# --- Build output. Rebuilt inside the image; copying it in would shadow the fresh build. ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
apps/api/target/
apps/web/dist/

# --- Not needed to build or run ---
.git/
.github/
.claude/
claude-design/
docs/
ops/
**/*.md
!README.md
# The SPA's /docs/mcp page is built from it.
!docs/mcp.md
# The Help panel's articles, bundled into the SPA.
!docs/help/*.md
# The assistant's playbooks, read from the classpath at boot: without them the API does not start.
!apps/api/src/main/resources/assistant/skills/**/SKILL.md
.editorconfig
.gitignore
